That's not quite enough.  I need to know what kind of alpha it is
(AlphaStation 200, 400, 500 etc, Multia, PC164 etc).  There is a good
chance that we support it since we run on most non-AlphaServer machines.
The main problem for your machine is that TGA isn't supported yet so you
would probably be limited to a serial console.  You will probably also
need to switch from the AlphaBIOS firmware which Linux normally uses to
the SRM firmware which is all we currently support.

